      "message": "[error] Line 61: 🔴 `VCPKG_BASELINE` is expanded unquoted in a `bat` command (`... checkout -q %VCPKG_BASELINE%`). Because this value comes from repository content (`contrib/vcpkg/vcpkg-configuration.json`), a crafted baseline string containing CMD metacharacters (`\u0026`, `|`, etc.) can trigger command injection on the Jenkins agent. Validate it first (e.g., strict `^[0-9a-fA-F]{40}$`) and pass it to Git in a safely quoted form (or perform checkout in PowerShell with argument arrays) before executing.",
