      "message": "[error] Line 79: 🔴 The binary cache is configured as a single shared `readwrite` location (`daemon-build\\\\vcpkg-archives`) for all builds. Any build that can run on this agent can write arbitrary cache artifacts that later builds may consume, creating a cache-poisoning/supply-chain risk. Split cache paths by trust boundary (at minimum separate untrusted/PR builds from protected branch/release builds), and make untrusted builds use `read` only or isolated write caches.",
      "revId": "44269344a59c63bdba883667c85a5d0138b6359f",
